---
title: "10 · Close the deal"
description: What happens to the files of a deal when the opportunity is won or lost.
sidebar:
  order: 11
  label: "10 · Close the deal"
---

When the opportunity moves to a Won or a Lost stage, its files are moved automatically. Nobody has to do anything.

| Client | What happens to the files |
|---|---|
| **A company** | Every file moves to the company's folder under **Client Docs**. The **Files** tab still lists them, marked **Moved to company files**, and the opportunity is no longer shown under **Cases**. |
| **An individual**, or no client linked | The files stay in the opportunity's folder. |

{% screenshot id="crm/close-won-moved" caption="After the deal is won: the files are marked as moved." /%}

{% screenshot id="crm/close-company-folder" caption="The files in the company's folder under Client Docs." /%}

## After the close

- If the move fails, the stage change still stands, and the move is tried again every 15 minutes.
- A file added after a company deal is closed goes straight to the company's folder.
- If the opportunity is reopened, new files go to the opportunity's own folder again.
